// Ch8 B09 "The stair, first down" (act1_ch08.md §2 B09; W09 → W10). In-engine. W09: the wall-head over
// the Fisher Stair; below, the low town is emptying into its lanes toward the stair foot. Hobb's voice,
// "First down!", and the stair-watch goes DOWN the stair against the crowd coming up, to bring up the
// slow. W10: the Stillguard shield-line at the stair-head. Ivo is in it. Toma takes the place beside
// him without being asked. "We hold the stair. That is all we do tonight." is the set-piece's rule,
// said in the fiction (§5a: Toma never goes on the offensive). The chapter flow autosaves here
// (checkpoint), then opens Wave 1.
title: ch08_first_down
location: ch08/corrow
---
@camera W09
@sfx crowd_on_stair
Hobb [determined]: First down! #line:ch08_first_down_001
@mark watch_a stair_down_a run via=way_stair_head_w
@mark watch_b stair_down_b run via=way_stair_head_w
@mark hobb stair_down_hobb run via=way_stair_head_w
@wait 2.0
@camera W10
@mark toma shield_line_toma walk
@anim toma shield_up
Ivo [determined]: Your shield. My wall. Same as ever. #line:ch08_first_down_002
Rhen [worried]: We're not going down after them? #line:ch08_first_down_003
Toma [determined]: We hold the stair. That is all we do tonight. #line:ch08_first_down_004
@music seawall_hold fade=1.0
===
